---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';

const heroImagePath = "/persona-4-golden-guide/p4g-key-art.png";
---

<GuideLayout title="What is Persona? | Persona 4 Golden Guide">
  <div class="persona-container">
    <header class="persona-header anim-pop">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <h1 class="font-pop">WHAT IS <span class="highlight">PERSONA?</span></h1>
        <div class="subtitle font-pop">A JOURNEY BEYOND THE MASK</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="divider bg-stripes"></div>

    <main class="content-box p4g-shadow anim-slide-in">


      <h2 class="font-pop">THE LEGACY OF THE MASK</h2>
      
      <div class="intro-section">
        <div class="text-content font-read">
          <p>
            The <span class="text-highlight">Persona</span> series is a renowned JRPG franchise developed by <span class="text-highlight">Atlus</span>. Originally a spinoff of the legendary <span class="text-highlight secondary">Megami Tensei</span> series, it has since grown to become one of the most iconic names in the genre, even surpassing the popularity of its parent franchise.
          </p>

          <p>
            The series is widely recognized for its unique blend of <span class="text-highlight">urban fantasy</span>, psychological depth, and social simulation. It is typically categorized into two distinct eras:
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hero-image-container anim-pop">
           <img src={heroImagePath} alt="Persona 4 Golden Key Art" class="hero-image p4g-shadow" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-content font-read">
        <div class="era-grid">
          <div class="era-card old-school">
            <h3 class="font-pop">OLD SCHOOL</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Revelations: Persona</li>
              <li>Persona 2: Innocent Sin</li>
              <li>Persona 2: Eternal Punishment</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="era-card new-school">
            <h3 class="font-pop">NEW SCHOOL</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Persona 3 (and FES/Portable/Reload)</li>
              <li>Persona 4 (and Golden)</li>
              <li>Persona 5 (and Royal)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          Beyond the mainline titles, the series has expanded into a massive multimedia project, including manga, anime series, stage plays, and various spinoff games like the <span class="text-highlight">Persona Q</span> dungeon crawlers, the <span class="text-highlight">Persona Arena</span> fighting games, and the <span class="text-highlight">Persona Dancing</span> titles.
        </p>

        <p>
          Of all these titles, <span class="text-highlight secondary">Persona 4</span> arguably remains the most beloved for its character-driven story and small-town charm. Since its release in 2008, it has become a cultural phenomenon. 
        </p>

        <div class="callout-box bg-yellow p4g-shadow">
          <h3 class="font-pop">WHY PLAY PERSONA 4?</h3>
          <p>
            It’s a masterfully crafted mix of <span class="text-highlight alert">dungeon crawling</span> and <span class="text-highlight alert">life simulation</span>. No explanation can truly do it justice—it’s an experience you have to feel for yourself. If you’re new to the series, Persona 4 (along with Persona 3 and 5) is the perfect place to start.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p>
          <span class="text-highlight">Persona 4 Golden</span> is the ultimate version of this masterpiece. Released for the PS Vita in 2012, it contains roughly <span class="text-highlight">50% more content</span> than the original PS2 game, including new characters, events, and a refined battle system. 
        </p>

        <p>
          With a <span class="text-highlight secondary">93 on Metacritic</span> and millions of copies sold worldwide across PS4, PC, Xbox, and Switch, Golden isn't just a remaster—it's the definitive way to experience one of the greatest JRPGs ever made.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="status-footer bg-stripes">
        <span class="font-pop">SYSTEM READY: REACH OUT TO THE TRUTH</span>
      </div>
    </main>

    <div class="bottom-decoration">
      <div class="tv-static-effect"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>

<style>
  .persona-container {
    max-width: 1250px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 0; /* Removing container padding for full-width header */
  }

  .persona-header {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--primary);
    border: 6px solid var(--secondary);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--secondary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header-inner {
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .persona-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
    color: var(--secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 0.9;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    transform: translateZ(0); /* Force GPU rendering for cleaner rotation */
  }

  .persona-header h1 .highlight {
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 0 0.8rem;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
    box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--accent-orange);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 1rem;
  }

  .content-box {
    background-color: #ededed;
    background-image: 
      radial-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 2px, transparent 2px),
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.7), rgba(255,255,255,0.7));
    background-size: 24px 24px, 100% 100%;
    border: 6px solid var(--secondary);
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--secondary);
  }

  .intro-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-image-container {
    position: relative;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
  }

  .hero-image-container:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.05);
  }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 4px solid var(--secondary);
    display: block;
  }



  .content-box::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 12px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--primary),
      var(--primary) 20px,
      var(--secondary) 20px,
      var(--secondary) 40px
    );
  }

  .content-box h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .text-content {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .text-content p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .text-highlight {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--secondary);
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--secondary);
    margin: 0 0.2rem;
  }

  .text-highlight.secondary {
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    color: var(--primary);
    transform: rotate(1deg);
  }

  .text-highlight.alert {
    background: var(--accent-orange);
    color: white;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }

  .era-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .era-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 4px solid var(--secondary);
    position: relative;
  }

  .era-card.old-school {
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary);
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  .era-card.new-school {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--secondary);
    transform: rotate(1deg);
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--secondary);
  }

  .era-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .era-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .era-card li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .callout-box {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 5px solid var(--secondary);
    transform: skewX(-2deg);
  }

  .callout-box h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: block;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bg-yellow {
    background: var(--primary);
  }

  .status-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    text-align: right;
    border: 4px solid var(--secondary);
  }

  .status-footer span {
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 0.3rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .bottom-decoration {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tv-static-effect {
    width: 200px;
    height: 6px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      transparent 10px,
      var(--secondary) 10px,
      var(--secondary) 20px
    );
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .persona-container {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .content-box {
      width: calc(100% - 1.5rem);
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--secondary);
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      transform: rotate(0) !important; /* Force symmetry on mobile */
      animation: slideInMobile 0.6s ease-out 0.6s both;
    }

    @keyframes slideInMobile {
      0% { transform: translateX(-20px) rotate(0); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: translateX(0) rotate(0); opacity: 1; }
    }
    
    .persona-header {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--secondary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-left: none;
      border-right: none;
    }

    .header-inner {
      transform: none;
    }
    
    .persona-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .persona-header h1 .highlight {
      transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      display: inline-block;
      width: auto;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .era-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    
    .intro-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .hero-image-container {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      transform: none;
    }

    .text-content {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .text-highlight {
      padding: 0 0.2rem;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--secondary);
    }
  }
</style>
